The "Detail" choices are used to set the amount of detail that will be displayed for the  files in the Directory Pane.  The available choices are: Name: to list only the name of the file, Brief: to list permissions, size, modification date and time, and name of the file, and Full: to list all of the above plus the owner and the group of the file.  You click SELECT on one of the boxes and on the "Apply" button to set the desired order.  The default is "Name".
